  "_levels": "Same shape as levels.json (systems/Recall.js reads both). techLevel[level-1] = the techniques.json `levels` key a technique is at (their tables go to 5). learn.rhea.recollection: from that level Rhea can cast the Recollection (the Ultimate button; it needs her Echo full). xpMult: Memories per enemy x this.",
