  "_buffs": "After every win: pick 1 of `buffCount` (shown in a random order, never one at its `max` stacks). Effect keys (systems/Fragments.js effectTotal sums every copy): maxHpPct (every hero's max HP +%), strikeBonus (Strike damage +n), dmgTakenPct (damage taken +%, negative = less; the total stops at minDmgTakenPct), healAfterFightPct (after each win, every standing hero heals % of max HP), xpPct (XP +%), and the story memories' keys: startEcho, perfectWindowMs, perfectEchoBonus, counterBonus, anchorBonus, nalaExtraUses, dovMaxHp.",
  "buffCount": 3,
  "minDmgTakenPct": -35,
  "buffs": {
    "a_thick_coat": { "name": "Thick Coat", "short": "C", "color": "#e0a040", "text": "Every hero: +10% max HP.", "effects": { "maxHpPct": 10 }, "max": 3 },
